### Admin courses
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses

### Create admin course
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pemrograman Backend Go",
  "instructor": "Dr. Backend Engineer",
  "assistant": "Asisten Go",
  "studyProgram": "Teknik Informatika",
  "academicYear": "Genap 2025/2026",
  "classCode": "GO-101",
  "status": "Aktif",
  "day": "Senin",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "11:00",
  "room": "Lab Backend",
  "sessions": 14,
  "credits": 3,
  "students": 0
}

